WEBVTT

01:19.450 --> 01:20.450
Dr. Sasaki!

01:21.740 --> 01:22.750
It's below us.

01:26.460 --> 01:27.290
Dr. Sasaki!

01:35.800 --> 01:42.010
<b><i>Lost - Omen</i></b>

01:41.140 --> 01:42.270
Dr. Sasaki!

01:44.520 --> 01:46.020
What's the matter?

01:47.600 --> 01:48.440
Come on!

01:48.440 --> 01:49.520
Let's get out of here!

02:09.670 --> 02:11.090
Get behind me!

02:17.300 --> 02:17.760
Emma!

02:18.050 --> 02:18.840
Take care of those two!

02:19.260 --> 02:19.890
Not a problem!

02:34.650 --> 02:36.070
Great, so now it can fly.

02:44.700 --> 02:46.580
Cyclops, we're back.

02:47.620 --> 02:49.830
The Blackbird's not going anywhere
so it looks like we're stuck.

03:09.270 --> 03:09.770
Hisako!

03:22.990 --> 03:24.830
What is that monster?

03:25.240 --> 03:27.700
It appears to be
focusing on Dr. Sasaki.

03:32.920 --> 03:33.920
As I suspected.

03:34.960 --> 03:37.840
It's a mutant suffering from Damon-Hall Syndrome.

03:38.460 --> 03:39.010
What?

03:39.670 --> 03:41.340
Damon-Hall Syndrome?

03:42.430 --> 03:45.430
They've been infected
with a virus that attacks the mutant genome.

03:46.220 --> 03:48.640
I've synthesized
a counter agent for it,

03:49.430 --> 03:51.440
but I doubt administering
it will be easy.

03:52.600 --> 03:53.650
We need to take it alive!

04:00.490 --> 04:01.490
But...

04:09.080 --> 04:11.000
We have to save this one!

04:12.830 --> 04:13.290
Hisako!

04:15.540 --> 04:18.630
Come on, Hisako,
get it together.

04:19.260 --> 04:21.420
Keep your head in the game!

04:22.180 --> 04:22.680
Okay!

05:11.180 --> 05:11.850
Do it now!

05:12.350 --> 05:13.600
Leave it to me!

05:30.030 --> 05:32.250
I thought I held back...

05:33.450 --> 05:35.710
They're just unconscious, right?

05:53.060 --> 05:53.890
Riko!

05:56.440 --> 05:58.860
Why did Riko...?

06:12.410 --> 06:13.830
What's with that punk?

06:14.620 --> 06:17.670
He's runnin' away as soon as
the monster's mask comes off?

06:18.540 --> 06:19.710
Aren't they comrades?

06:30.890 --> 06:33.680
We <i>will</i> soon enter
Japanese airspace.

06:39.850 --> 06:44.030
<i>Once, on an investigation of
a mutant activity outbreak in Japan,</i>

06:44.030 --> 06:50.530
<i>I came to Tohoku</i>
<i>and met Sasaki Yui.</i>

06:52.330 --> 06:57.960
<i>Yui loved even mutant children
without discrimination.</i>

07:01.580 --> 07:02.340
<i>And so...</i>

07:12.800 --> 07:15.850
<i>we fell fiercely in love.</i>

07:18.810 --> 07:23.860
<i>I asked Yui to come with me</i>
<i>on my mission to New York.</i>

07:25.190 --> 07:26.320
<i>But Yui said to me,</i>

07:27.780 --> 07:30.700
<i>There are children
here I must protect,</i>

07:31.570 --> 07:34.660
<i>just like there are children
for you in New York.</i>

07:36.660 --> 07:38.450
<i>I can't</i> leave <i>those</i>
<i>children behind.</i>

07:39.910 --> 07:43.880
<i>You understand that better
than anyone else, don't you?</i>

07:46.590 --> 07:52.300
<i>The next time I visited Tohoku
was a few years later.</i>

07:53.800 --> 07:57.260
<i>But Yui refused
to rekindle that flame.</i>

08:05.270 --> 08:06.900
<i>That boy you are seeing</i>

08:07.360 --> 08:08.530
<i>is probably Takeo.</i>

08:09.110 --> 08:10.030
Takeo?

08:12.410 --> 08:13.320
<i>My son.</i>

08:13.950 --> 08:16.030
<i>Mine, and yours.</i>

08:17.370 --> 08:24.040
<i>Now that I think about it, was that
her preventing me from meeting our son?</i>

08:25.130 --> 08:31.840
<i>Perhaps our son also
had mutant powers?</i>

08:32.880 --> 08:36.850
<i>But, as she said, our son is...</i>

08:38.260 --> 08:40.350
<i>...not in this world.</i>

08:46.860 --> 08:52.860
<i>The existence of my son,
and his appearance in my mind...</i>

08:53.610 --> 08:57.620
<i>I don't think these events are unrelated
to the chain of mutant incidents.</i>

08:58.990 --> 09:02.910
<i>I</i> must meet with Yui and have her explain
the details to me no matter what.

09:09.590 --> 09:13.470
The medicine is working,
so she won't wake up for a while.

09:13.470 --> 09:17.390
I can't know the details without examining
her at the Xavier Institute,

09:18.010 --> 09:21.390
but she's definitely exhibiting symptoms
of Damon-Hall Syndrome.

09:22.810 --> 09:28.770
But if this is her first outbreak,
the vaccine I developed should control it.

09:30.320 --> 09:30.940
Yui.

09:32.190 --> 09:33.690
I'll vaccinate her.

09:34.740 --> 09:35.910
Please do.

09:42.160 --> 09:44.960
It seems like she's been
taking shots quite regularly.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.040
What kind of shots?

09:46.670 --> 09:47.670
Well...

09:48.460 --> 09:49.630
I have no idea.

09:50.290 --> 09:54.010
But when she was tired,
she often used an intravenous drip.

09:55.050 --> 09:57.840
This is the wrong place
to insert an IV, isn't it?

09:58.390 --> 10:02.600
Unfortunately,
I don't interfere with her private life,

10:02.600 --> 10:04.980
so I don't know
any more than that.

10:12.440 --> 10:15.820
I was surprised to learn
that Riko was that monster,

10:15.820 --> 10:18.780
but she'll be
okay now, Dr. Sasaki.

10:18.780 --> 10:23.240
Since she took the vaccine, I don't
think she'll go berserk any more.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.290
Right, Emma?

10:25.620 --> 10:26.330
Right.

10:34.710 --> 10:36.590
Where did Kaga go?

10:42.560 --> 10:44.310
It's lrasaki Riko's room.

10:45.310 --> 10:47.890
Looks like she was here when she broke
out with Damon-Hall Syndrome.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.060
Yeah.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.580
To think it turned out like this...

11:08.710 --> 11:10.000
He's in here.

11:10.500 --> 11:11.830
Hey, open this door!

11:13.840 --> 11:16.630
If you don't, I'll open it myself!

11:22.390 --> 11:24.350
Are you a mutant too?

11:26.430 --> 11:30.100
When we found out that
the monster was lrasaki Riko,

11:30.100 --> 11:32.980
you sure panicked a lot.

11:35.520 --> 11:36.360
Yes.

11:36.900 --> 11:41.950
Both Riko and I awakened
and entered the Sasaki Institute.

11:43.160 --> 11:45.030
When the Institute was closed,

11:45.830 --> 11:49.080
Dr. Sasaki asked us to be assistants
for mutant research.

11:49.750 --> 11:54.250
Ever since then,
I've worked with Riko.

11:56.130 --> 11:57.630
And then, she...

11:57.630 --> 11:58.710
turned into that.

12:01.970 --> 12:03.510
What shots were you taking?

12:04.470 --> 12:05.890
That's...

12:05.890 --> 12:08.060
lrasaki Riko was taking them too.

12:08.470 --> 12:10.390
Are they so dangerous that
you can't tell us what they are?

12:11.980 --> 12:16.190
I can't tell you without
the Doctor's permission.

12:16.820 --> 12:18.030
I see.

12:18.030 --> 12:20.490
Sasaki Yui told you to be quiet.

12:21.950 --> 12:24.280
Is Sanada Jun also a mutant?

12:24.950 --> 12:25.820
Yes.

12:26.580 --> 12:28.040
Is he also from Sasaki Institute?

12:28.990 --> 12:29.950
No.

12:30.370 --> 12:33.250
It's been almost six months
since he came here.

12:34.080 --> 12:38.800
Dr. Sasaki brought him in
because he's an excellent researcher.

12:39.800 --> 12:44.130
Is it really just the four of
you in this research lab?

12:44.130 --> 12:45.050
Yes.

12:46.100 --> 12:49.010
In any case, we'll have
you take the vaccine

12:49.010 --> 12:51.850
that Beast developed at
the Xavier Institute.

12:53.140 --> 12:55.600
But, what will the Doctor say?

12:56.520 --> 12:58.860
Again with the "Doctor".

12:58.860 --> 13:01.690
I trust her.

13:02.780 --> 13:03.820
Jeez.

13:08.450 --> 13:11.000
But really, why?

13:11.750 --> 13:14.290
There are so
many mutants in this area,

13:15.000 --> 13:17.460
and yet Cerebro
didn't detect any of them.

13:18.000 --> 13:25.590
In addition, many of them near this facility
exhibit Damon-Hall Syndrome.

13:26.590 --> 13:27.430
Is that so?

13:28.640 --> 13:29.850
I didn't know.

13:31.220 --> 13:32.140
Honestly!

13:33.520 --> 13:36.020
I've never heard of
anything like that...

13:36.020 --> 13:39.110
I don't think there
is any way that you,

13:40.570 --> 13:43.530
a researcher of mutant medical care,
would be unaware.

13:45.900 --> 13:47.320
It's the same with her.

13:48.570 --> 13:50.830
If you had told us
that she was a mutant,

13:51.330 --> 13:53.290
this never would have happened.

13:55.120 --> 14:00.420
I never thought
this would happen to Riko.

14:03.300 --> 14:06.590
I'm sorry, this is just too much.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.640
I must rest a bit.

14:13.640 --> 14:15.230
Dr. Sasaki...

14:23.150 --> 14:23.980
This is bad!

14:23.980 --> 14:25.490
It's a secondary mutation!

14:51.350 --> 14:52.140
Dammit.

14:52.680 --> 14:53.720
After him!

14:53.720 --> 14:54.310
Yeah!

15:03.230 --> 15:04.980
Why did this happen...

15:23.920 --> 15:24.420
Ka...

15:25.210 --> 15:26.210
Kaga...

15:30.550 --> 15:31.090
There he is!

15:37.310 --> 15:38.810
Dr. Sasaki!

15:39.440 --> 15:41.770
Now, our hands are tied.

15:42.100 --> 15:42.980
It's Kaga!

15:42.980 --> 15:44.940
He's under the influence of
Damon-Hall Syndrome!

15:45.610 --> 15:48.070
It doesn't feel like he plans
to hurt Sasaki Yui.

15:48.820 --> 15:50.610
What's he thinkin'?

15:51.910 --> 15:52.990
Maybe...

15:53.660 --> 15:55.330
he's in love with her.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.290
With Sasaki Yui.

15:57.290 --> 15:59.250
I-In love?!

15:59.870 --> 16:02.540
You saw his meek
attitude towards her.

16:03.580 --> 16:06.210
He's been with her
ever since he was a boy.

16:06.210 --> 16:09.170
It wouldn't be strange for him
to at least have a superficial crush.

16:09.760 --> 16:13.680
So once he loses his reason,
his real emotions come out?

16:14.760 --> 16:16.850
Give back Dr. Sasaki!

16:16.850 --> 16:17.560
Hisako!

16:22.600 --> 16:23.310
Hisako!

16:30.940 --> 16:32.820
S-Stop.

16:35.780 --> 16:36.830
Kaga...

16:37.450 --> 16:38.540
stop this...

16:43.000 --> 16:43.790
Please.

17:04.520 --> 17:06.190
Has he returned to his senses?

17:06.650 --> 17:08.570
No, don't letdown your guard.

17:28.210 --> 17:29.130
Dammit!

17:33.510 --> 17:34.300
Wolverine!

17:39.930 --> 17:41.640
Are you okay, Wolverine?

17:42.020 --> 17:42.720
Peachy.

17:51.730 --> 17:52.650
<i>That's...!</i>

18:15.340 --> 18:16.880
He's strong!

18:17.380 --> 18:18.800
I can't even budge him!

18:21.760 --> 18:22.930
Now, Hisako!

18:23.470 --> 18:24.020
Okay!

18:44.370 --> 18:45.080
We did it!

18:45.750 --> 18:47.790
Finally put him to sleep.

19:05.770 --> 19:08.100
Sanada Jun.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.730
Cyclops, you okay?

19:12.940 --> 19:14.610
You got knocked out pretty quick.

19:15.150 --> 19:15.780
I'm fine.

19:16.900 --> 19:19.570
His mutation seems
to have calmed down.

19:19.570 --> 19:21.570
We have to give him
the vaccine quickly.

19:23.870 --> 19:27.200
Look, he was crying.

19:36.420 --> 19:38.420
Dr. Sasaki...

19:41.130 --> 19:42.090
Why...

19:42.090 --> 19:43.350
even Kaga...

19:43.760 --> 19:45.890
I injected him with the vaccine,

19:45.890 --> 19:47.890
but like lrasaki Riko,

19:47.890 --> 19:50.520
he had been taking shots
into his left arm.

19:51.020 --> 19:54.060
Is that also from
intravenous drip?

19:57.440 --> 20:01.490
I want to vaccinate
your remaining assistant.

20:02.160 --> 20:03.120
Jun?

20:04.280 --> 20:05.700
I'll call him later.

20:08.580 --> 20:10.210
Look at this.

20:10.210 --> 20:12.000
It's some kind of medicine.

20:12.000 --> 20:16.040
There were tons of
it in the fridge.

20:24.430 --> 20:26.100
Dr. Sasaki...

20:30.890 --> 20:33.650
Now, let's have an explanation.

20:47.200 --> 20:49.490
<i>Now entering Tohoku airspace.</i>

20:49.490 --> 20:51.910
<i>Prepare for landing.</i>

21:08.260 --> 21:09.850
What was that?

21:10.640 --> 21:13.770
So many things flooded
my consciousness.

21:14.770 --> 21:17.440
As it is, I can't locate the X-Men.

23:04.210 --> 23:08.340
The anomalies in the mutant population
in the Tohoku region

23:09.220 --> 23:13.140
have all been traced back
to Dr. Sasaki's research facility.

23:14.010 --> 23:16.100
Yui obstinately refuses
to say anything.

23:16.730 --> 23:21.860
At the same time, Emma appears before the
assistant Jun in the underground facility,

23:22.360 --> 23:24.900
and exposes his true, hidden nature.

23:25.690 --> 23:31.070
<b><i>Revelations - Mastermind</i></b>

23:25.860 --> 23:29.150
Next time, on X-Men: Mastermind.
